{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411330","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411330","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1241133001:1":{"text":"メイメイ、グレイヴボーンを退治できる魔法ポーションを作ってくれない？それを剣に塗りたいんだ。","source_cn":"漫漫，你能不能帮我研制一些可以驱逐亡灵的魔法药水？我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C9029FF2E843AD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241133002:1":{"text":"剣に……？でも、その剣はもう十分鋭いわよ？","source_cn":"涂在剑上……？可你的剑已经足够锋利了呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E40D61695C6EF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241133003:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーン相手だと、それだけじゃ足りないんだよ！もっと効果的な方法を考えないと。","source_cn":"但对付亡灵不能只靠一把剑！我看看有没有更有效的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB824CC950FC2DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241133004:1":{"text":"いい方法があれば、これからグレイヴボーンと戦う時、もっと有利になれるだろ？","source_cn":"如果能找到有用的办法，以后面对亡灵敌人就事半功倍了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA568039B16E9F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}